# Svgbob ASCII diagrams
	: fname=svgbob.jpg notitle theme=github-light
	# Standalone diagram
		: svgbob
		:
		: +---------+     +----------+
		: | outline |---->| renderer |
		: +---------+     +----------+
	# Diagram inside Markdown
		: md noheader md_wrap=off ctrans
		:
		: ### Local rendering pipeline
		:
		: ```svgbob
		: +-------+     +-----+     +-----+
		: | ASCII |---->| SVG |---->| PNG |
		: +-------+     +-----+     +-----+
		: ```
		:
		: Source spacing is preserved; the node grows to fit the diagram.
